Notes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The HTTP stack (requests, urllib3, certifi, idna, charset-normalizer) and the
interactive shell (ipython and its dependencies) enter the closure as
transitive dependencies of build123d. No MyCAD module imports them; the
`tests/test_scope_audit.py` import audit enforces that.

Platform variation: `pexpect` is installed only on non-Windows systems,
while `colorama` appears on Windows instead (`sys_platform == 'win32'`
markers in the lockfile). Both are attributed above; the per-platform
closure count stays 54 either way. The phase-1 additions (pyopengl,
pyqtgraph, the pyside6 wheel family, shiboken6) carry no platform
markers anywhere in uv.lock, so 54 holds on all three T1 platforms.
